    61	    def ok(self) -> bool:
    62	        """PASS only on the checks that can contradict us, and only on completeness.
    63	
    64	        A self-graded check never decides a verdict: a fill rate of 99% is equally consistent
    65	        with 99% correct and 40% correct, and letting it vote would make the verdict mean less
    66	        than it appears to.
